### Request API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 의뢰 생성 (Create Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "REQ001",
  "requestDateFrom": "2024-01-01",
  "requestDateTo": "2024-01-10",
  "organizationId": 1,
  "patientId": 1,
  "sampleId": 1,
  "testContent": "유전체 분석",
  "diseaseCode": "C50.9",
  "sampleCollectedDate": "2024-01-01",
  "report": "임상 정보",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "extensionIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### 2. 의뢰 목록 조회 (Get All Requests)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3. 의뢰 상세 조회 (Get Request by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4. 기관별 의뢰 조회 (Get Requests by Organization)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/organization/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5. 환자별 의뢰 조회 (Get Requests by Patient)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/patient/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6. 의뢰일 범위 검색 (Search Requests by Date Range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/search/date?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7. 의뢰 정보 수정 (Update Request)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "requestDateFrom": "2024-01-01",
  "requestDateTo": "2024-01-10",
  "organizationId": 1,
  "patientId": 1,
  "sampleId": 1,
  "testContent": "유전체 분석 (업데이트)",
  "diseaseCode": "C50.9",
  "sampleCollectedDate": "2024-01-01",
  "report": "임상 정보 수정",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### 8. 의뢰 상태 변경 (Change Request Status)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/status
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### 9. 의뢰에 확장항목 추가 (Add Extension to Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/extensions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "extensionIds": [4, 5]
}

### 10. 의뢰의 확장항목 조회 (Get Request Extensions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1/extensions
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 11. 의뢰 삭제 (Delete Request)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/1

### 12. 중복 일련번호 체크 (Check Duplicate Serial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/check-serial/REQ001
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 13. 의뢰 생성 - 필수값 누락 (Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "",
  "requestDateFrom": "",
  "requestDateTo": ""
}

### 14. 의뢰 생성 - 존재하지 않는 기관 (Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "REQ002",
  "requestDateFrom": "2024-01-01",
  "requestDateTo": "2024-01-10",
  "organizationId": 99999,
  "patientId": 1,
  "sampleId": 1
}

### 15. 의뢰 생성 - 잘못된 날짜 범위 (Invalid Date Range)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "REQ003",
  "requestDateFrom": "2024-01-10",
  "requestDateTo": "2024-01-01",
  "organizationId": 1,
  "patientId": 1,
  "sampleId": 1
}

### 16. 존재하지 않는 의뢰 조회 (Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/99999
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 17. 복잡한 검색 (Complex Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/search?organizationId=1&status=PENDING&from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31
Accept: {{contentType}}
